        "profile_note": "Anchored to AWS Ocelot (Nature 2025): distance-5 repetition code, 5 cat data qubits + 4 ancilla transmons (9 qubits vs 49 for a surface-code d=5), error-correction cycle 2-3 us, phase-flip time 27-33 us, bit-flip time > 1 ms, total logical error per cycle 1.75 % (d=3) and 1.65 % (d=5), i.e. no improvement with distance (convergedigest / postquantum coverage of the paper, via search). Parameters tuned so p_eff is at threshold: assumption."
      },
